{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.poster.avif?t=1774117233\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.webm?t=1774117233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/8c9ff27ec5ef308f6fa360ad74f056ef.mp4?t=1774117233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the world of Arcadia, where a candy-colored, manga-inspired reality collides with the dark power of portals unleashed by the rising might of the Demon Lord</strong>. Step into the shoes of an ordinary FPS gamer, accidentally summoned to another world to save an adorable realm full of cute creatures\u2026 now twisted by the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your arsenal, fuse monstrous cores with your weapons, increase your rank, and battle increasingly powerful demons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.poster.avif?t=1774117233\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.webm?t=1774117233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/d8916588eac131b2e5f33dee3877e984.mp4?t=1774117233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From waves of cute yet grotesque monsters and battles against the demon army's officers to a showdown with the Demon Lord himself-get ready for fast-paced, anime-style action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the favor of the Goddesses (each with her own quirky personality), earn divine blessings, uncover the secrets of the celestial pantheon, and prove that even a regular gamer can become the savior of another world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.poster.avif?t=1774117233\" width=610 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.webm?t=1774117233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/154970985615d5f97b41bb344720f64a.mp4?t=1774117233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With humor, fast-paced FPS combat, and a touch of divine chaos - this is an adventure you won\u2019t forget!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right from the start, you receive a divine gift, <strong>a hero\u2019s special ability\u2026</strong> <strong>You can shop online!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pistol Arsenal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553190/409c384cdb197e381e86b4206442fb45edee5835.jpg"},{"name":"Rifle Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553190/a9fd559317666b283fa2e6c2c2ccfe5c6f16d34c.jpg"},{"name":"First Strides","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553190/795b0159284f53b79fb43f986915b27215335b96.jpg"},{"name":"Solid Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3553190/3db3097544405cf18f5cb4ae273